   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_b9a960b1fbe5fcd6ac42",
   "sourceHash": "b9a960b1fbe5fcd6ac42a7b93592913efb0f1946fb0f00bbaaa456e6f291fba8",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]◆[[CLOSE_1]][[OPEN_2]]Cuidados confidenciais e dignos num ambiente privado[[CLOSE_2]]",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_b4f5bc9364657bfc7cf0",
   "sourceHash": "b4f5bc9364657bfc7cf0f8612ea9a80d3e815e4081216c871f1e6a511416ecd6",
   "text": "A base do nosso tratamento",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_964b7520c498824fb90a",
   "sourceHash": "964b7520c498824fb90a07872727445223bdd73e84713bfd3721bb6d1c52c740",
   "text": "Uma filosofia de tratamento. Personalizada para cada percurso de vida.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_85448cd0a4d73be5db5b",
   "sourceHash": "85448cd0a4d73be5db5bd6cd2b56b57417c49d722aca8aaa1a9262e735d76f90",
   "text": "Seja quem for e seja qual for o programa que procura — a base de cada tratamento na Kairali mantém-se inalterada.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_e06186578b7257b7d4f1",
   "sourceHash": "e06186578b7257b7d4f16b7ee4e3331fd649149667ef1c02f285f28b166dc560",
   "text": "Ayurveda orientado por médicos",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_32ff5b1d3ff102ee2a42",
   "sourceHash": "32ff5b1d3ff102ee2a428fc05517ff3c2746be1800ca1ce08d57e25ebdaad6fe",
   "text": "Protocolos individualizados",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_6d515e675053bc9704f5",
   "sourceHash": "6d515e675053bc9704f59a6a9585b7ae6fa75f8737d4591f2efe2635a5b36b6b",
   "text": "Tratamento ético e não comercial",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_0acaea3c242de37d1cf3",
   "sourceHash": "0acaea3c242de37d1cf3d86a2c0817c1b99aaafa59b2b738defde54ff8d30d58",
   "text": "Não são ofertas promocionais. São compromissos assumidos no espírito do Ayurveda — servir quem mais o merece.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_77b543ba75eb84c218bb",
   "sourceHash": "77b543ba75eb84c218bbc056e7efd3213f29730a81f1f465ba99671da5a43e54",
   "text": "Um ambiente tranquilo e envolvente",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_63db53c2d2d7de396881",
   "sourceHash": "63db53c2d2d7de3968815ac1c7d807f87162232211966e25a671454a6b272ce5",
   "text": "Catorze acres de paz em Palakkad, Kerala. Sem ruído, sem pressa — apenas as condições em que uma recuperação genuína se torna possível.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_1472cd097c5aeff7d847",
   "sourceHash": "1472cd097c5aeff7d8478d714abcdbbb6ad0b57cb12456f9919d8c14f0c1f59a",
   "text": "Um processo simples e sem pressas — pensado para que se possa concentrar em estar presente, e não na papelada.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_03c206191210116f7f84",
   "sourceHash": "03c206191210116f7f8462bb6a5323f538496b700dbe97f5031477c48a497bf8",
   "text": "Consulta médica",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_8e513fabd68c99ef80ad",
   "sourceHash": "8e513fabd68c99ef80ad0f5a6582104ea2d648d06b84fae17d2a9aed99cc4dd3",
   "text": "Uma avaliação minuciosa pelo nosso médico ayurvédico — o seu historial de saúde, o estado atual e os seus objetivos analisados com total atenção.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_5c500c0f8d63bf24017d",
   "sourceHash": "5c500c0f8d63bf24017dd2fdcba7f49f9d22e243659955584de2728c352cdc30",
   "text": "Plano de cuidados personalizado",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_8a9516a8e922af029c31",
   "sourceHash": "8a9516a8e922af029c31e6aa25208ea008d5df67925ec39272668b1d40f1055b",
   "text": "Um programa concebido especificamente para si — terapias, alimentação, rotina diária e duração — adaptado à sua constituição única.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f005f5c85a26dc6a4210",
   "sourceHash": "f005f5c85a26dc6a42108370139d64d2ee14cc754584920c2b0a473bc9e9d615",
   "text": "Terapias acompanhadas e estadia",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_ea1540dca992e5dbbbaf",
   "sourceHash": "ea1540dca992e5dbbbaf721c9a6df4d74076d851d0117470032c4db98dff1687",
   "text": "Terapias suaves, administradas por especialistas num ambiente calmo. O seu conforto e a sua segurança são acompanhados ao longo de toda a estadia.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_8fb571890cb22e6a7014",
   "sourceHash": "8fb571890cb22e6a70148e71900d0f9daa5bdd0b5d3318b4affdd5c6bd3a880d",
   "text": "Orientação após o programa",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  }
 ]
}
